{"3723290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rookie", "steam_appid": 3723290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You always wanted to become raided by police without having to worry about real consequences? Then Rookie will give you the chance to. Start your career by printing and selling fake money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/f7a065fc47a70b763fa5b5a17f985898.poster.avif?t=1773946752\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/f7a065fc47a70b763fa5b5a17f985898.webm?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/f7a065fc47a70b763fa5b5a17f985898.mp4?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of a round is to produce as much illegal stuff as possible and send your truck away with it. But be aware of the raid meter which fills up over time. Once full the police will come for you. To make things worse journalists will randomly appear to make your life harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there are also good news: you are allowed to keep the money across rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/230908d79d213993bfc7d7998feb4b34.poster.avif?t=1773946752\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/230908d79d213993bfc7d7998feb4b34.webm?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/230908d79d213993bfc7d7998feb4b34.mp4?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your machines and workers take care about the factory part you have to &quot;motivate&quot; them by clicking. E.g. the first click on a machine will start production while the second one will make it resetting its state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you have to keep an eye on your belongings in order to keep the factory running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/bcb057e35490f3ff4133e42d47716882.poster.avif?t=1773946752\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/bcb057e35490f3ff4133e42d47716882.webm?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/bcb057e35490f3ff4133e42d47716882.mp4?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lets talk about the money you got. This is not just because everyone loves to have money - no you also can spend it. The game has a lot of upgrades available for your factory to make your life more easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are like money: persistent. So once bought you will keep them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/7140b4005bc3992d76af6420258fffd1.poster.avif?t=1773946752\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/7140b4005bc3992d76af6420258fffd1.webm?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/7140b4005bc3992d76af6420258fffd1.mp4?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course the police is not happy about what you are doing and soon or late will raid you once the raid-meter is full. While it will fill automatically over time there is an additional threat: Journalists. They randomly appear and try to take photos from evidences. Each photo will reduce the time until a raid will happen! But you can prevent this from happening by clicking the journalists so that they will disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefor: Check your surroundings and don't feel to save. Journalists can appear any time!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You always wanted to become raided by police without having to worry about real consequences? Then Rookie will give you the chance to. Start your career by printing and selling fake money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/f7a065fc47a70b763fa5b5a17f985898.poster.avif?t=1773946752\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/f7a065fc47a70b763fa5b5a17f985898.webm?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/f7a065fc47a70b763fa5b5a17f985898.mp4?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of a round is to produce as much illegal stuff as possible and send your truck away with it. But be aware of the raid meter which fills up over time. Once full the police will come for you. To make things worse journalists will randomly appear to make your life harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there are also good news: you are allowed to keep the money across rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/230908d79d213993bfc7d7998feb4b34.poster.avif?t=1773946752\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/230908d79d213993bfc7d7998feb4b34.webm?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/230908d79d213993bfc7d7998feb4b34.mp4?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your machines and workers take care about the factory part you have to &quot;motivate&quot; them by clicking. E.g. the first click on a machine will start production while the second one will make it resetting its state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you have to keep an eye on your belongings in order to keep the factory running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/bcb057e35490f3ff4133e42d47716882.poster.avif?t=1773946752\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/bcb057e35490f3ff4133e42d47716882.webm?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/bcb057e35490f3ff4133e42d47716882.mp4?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lets talk about the money you got. This is not just because everyone loves to have money - no you also can spend it. The game has a lot of upgrades available for your factory to make your life more easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are like money: persistent. So once bought you will keep them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/7140b4005bc3992d76af6420258fffd1.poster.avif?t=1773946752\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/7140b4005bc3992d76af6420258fffd1.webm?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/extras/7140b4005bc3992d76af6420258fffd1.mp4?t=1773946752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course the police is not happy about what you are doing and soon or late will raid you once the raid-meter is full. While it will fill automatically over time there is an additional threat: Journalists. They randomly appear and try to take photos from evidences. Each photo will reduce the time until a raid will happen! But you can prevent this from happening by clicking the journalists so that they will disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefor: Check your surroundings and don't feel to save. Journalists can appear any time!</p>", "short_description": "Rookie is a factory roguelite clicker game with a lot of upgrade posibilities. Produce the bad goods until the Police will come for a &quot;visit&quot;.", "supported_languages": "English, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723290/b4913a2e2528eb220c9e7337393178e1717d56e5/header.jpg?t=1773946752", "capsule_image": "https://shared.a